          "clips": [],
          "body": "![](/media/ext/d11n7da8rpqbjy/mikesalemi/29566101_16586046324fIEbook_Sample_Cover_and_Body_Designs_1.png)\n\n---\n\n**YOUR ROADMAP TO KETTLEBELL PROGRESSION**\n\nIdentify where you are on this roadmap and train accordingly.\n\nBeginners should start at phase 1. If you’ve been training for a while, scan through and see which phase suits you best. I’ve included links to short video demonstrations of many of these movements.",
          "description": null,
          "attachments": []
        }
